E0056 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0056)

  x pattern expects a tuple with 3 elements but scrutinee has type `(i64, bool)`
   ,-[test.star:2:11]
 1 | fn test(pair: (i64, bool)) -> i64 {
 2 |     match pair {
   :           ^^^^^
 3 |         (a, b, c) => {
   :         ^^^^^|^^^^
   :              `-- type mismatch
 4 |             a
   `----
